  "changelog": "Initial release: Deep learning-based cloud removal and image enhancement for remote sensing using GAN (U-Net + PatchGAN), with CUDA GPU support.\n\n- Provides cloud removal (with mask detection and pixel reconstruction) and image enhancement (denoising autoencoder) modes.\n- Includes pretrained weights for immediate use or automatic training on first run.\n- Outputs reconstructed/enhanced images, cloud masks, and evaluation metrics in standard formats (GeoTIFF/JSON).\n- Runs fully offline; all processing is local and user data remains private.\n- Supports both synthetic and real single-band GeoTIFF imagery.\n- Baseline numpy operators included for comparison and testing.",
